@node "Final words .."

	@{b}Final words ..@{ub}

	This util has been developed and updated under a very long period.
	The first version was made for /X 1.1x so you could imagine.
	During this time period since July 1992 I've coded more and more
	utilities for this package and even integrated several doors like
	Quest, which was a stand-alone door before. This has given the sysop
	more and more power with these tools and today it covers a wide
	range of sysop applications. I'm therefore very proud to give you
	this package which is the result of many hours of hard work.

	Later in 1994 I will start with the hard work to translate these
	doors to the C language, to improve the speed some. However
	because these doors are extremely well coded in ARexx, there won't
	be such a big speed improvement. I will start with the smaller doors
	of this package and finally take the most complex door, Account ED.

	I hope you will get very much use of these utils and that they
	will give you some more spare time!

	If I get the chance I hope to have a chat with you at a party,
	maybe at the Party IV !? (In Denmark) !!!

	I would be grateful if you called GANG BANG and came with complaints,
	ideas or whatever you may come up with, on all my doors!

	This program is @{"Copyright" LINK "Disclaimer, Copyrights"} Delusion of Virtual and may not be sold in
	any form or made profitable on without the permission of the author.

	May the force be with you,

	Yours, Delusion of Virtual, Friday 8 April 1994

	@{" Thanks to my Beta Testers " LINK "Beta Testers"}
 
                                                        @{b}A DLS Dezign Prod 94'@{ub}
@endnode

