@node "Account ED Package Histories"

	History for all programs included in the Account ED Package

	@{" Account ED       History " LINK "Account ED History"}
	@{" F6 Editor        History " LINK "F6 Editor History"}
	@{" Quest            History " LINK "Quest History"}
	@{" Quest View       History " LINK "Quest View History"}
	@{" Password Fail    History " LINK "Password Fail History"}
	@{" Security Checker History " LINK "Security Checker History"}
@endnode

@node "Account ED History"

	@{b}@{u}Account ED © Delusion of Virtual 1992, 1993, 1994@{ub}@{uu}

	@{i}Virtual Account ED, History@{ui}

 @{b}08-28-92 V1.00@{ub}

      ° First version & Release version. Everything is new features
	so I won't tell you them again, just take a closer look at the doc

 @{b}09-04-92 V1.01@{ub}

      ° VERY NASTY BUG found, when you saved an account where you had
	changed the users name, the user couldn't log in to the BBS because
	AmiEx couldn't find the name! Fixed!! Puuh, sorry guys! I forgot to
	save the new name in the user.keys file! The new routine also cleans
	up the user keys file :)
      ° Bug fixed with the New Users Scan... I changed some things just
	before I released the first version and a bug slipped thru, but it
	now even works greater!!
      ° You can now specify a conf that no one can give access to i.e. a conf
	for only the members in your group or so!
      ° It now writes a line in the CallersLog file:
	Account Editing... SecLevel: 255 (AccED) Where seclevel is the
	security level of the person who account edited!
      ° You can view the log file within the program with the command LOG
      ° Many opening and closing with the user data file was removed to
	increase speed while accessing the hard drive, therefor Do not
	read/write the user data with another program when using Account ED!
      ° Finally: Take a look at the doc file for more info how to set the NEW
	CONFIG PARAMETERS provided in this new version! All external files
	are STILL compatible backwards :)

 @{b}03-27-93 V1.03@{ub} @{i}Major Update for /X 2.35+@{ui}

      ° The program is now fixed for @{"AmiExpress" LINK "AmiExpress"} 2.30+
      ° Fixed bug then a board had more than 255 users my util freaked out
      ° Added in extra security checks so you now must have all users who
        should have access to account ed in a list
      ° Added in so the sysop can specify a time period when no one is
        allowed to use account ed, like between 24.00 and 08.00 for instance
      ° Added in compatibility with Virtual Quest (Questionary Door Helper)
        so you now only have to push a button to get the users answers while
        you are account editing that particular user!
      ° Added in an extra help page inside the @{"Account Editor" LINK "About Account ED"} for all commands
      ° Added in the new functions like users baud rate, top cps ul/dl i.e.
      ° Added in so you can give each preset a description so your cosysop
        knows which preset to give to different users!
      ° Code optimized and the preset file is NOT compatible backwards!

 @{b}04-05-93 V1.04@{ub} @{i}DeZign@{ui}

      ° The layout of the account editor improved a redesigned
      ° Due to the sillyness of the /X standard of keys for different
	functions inside the account editor I have remapped the keyboard
	functions to be more easy to overview and so on
      ° Added the computerlist to the preset file for faster program start
      ° Added in one more option to each preset, Autorejoin conference!
	this functions is placed in the 5:th row from the left. Please
	look in the manual for more information.
      ° Documentation rewritten and freshened up a bit, hope you'll like it!
      ° Added in built in calculator which will help you adding bytes or
	subtracting bytes from a users account. It works on everything
	that has got with the users upload, downloads to do. These are
	the mathematic chars it can handle, +, -, * and / .. Try it!
      ° Finally I've managed to retain the information with the last on date
	so now you can see then a user was last on
      ° Adding a new feature giving a rating on all users you browse through
	I'm not really sure yet if this rating is a fair one, haven't tested
	it yet on so much users, but as far as I can see I think it's pretty
	fair. It gives a user a rating number depending on how much he
	has uploaded, downloaded, written and called. If a user has a negative
	number I really think you should talk with that user!
      ° You can now press TAB when you have searched for a user and want
	to continue searching. This goes for the New Users commands as well!
      ° You can now press SPACE to reload a users account if you have
	changed something wrong in the account!
      ° Added in so you could choose a security level for seeing users
	passwords when browsing through the accounts. If you sets this to 255
	it means that only the sysop will see different users passwords, but
	the cosysops could see all other information about a users!
      ° Added in so you have to push a special button for showing a users
	password so no one beside you will see it by mistake! This function
	is toogled, so you can set the default, on / off. Press SHIFT+C
	to toggle a password. You can't edit a password when not displayed!
	This idea originally came from Excelsior of Virtual! Thanx m8!
      ° Password option added to access AccED, wanted by It of Cryptoburners

 @{b}05-01-93 V1.05@{ub} @{i}OptimiZe made at the Gathering II in Norway@{ui}

      ° Search for name routine fastened up around 500% I think,
	it should now be equal to the built in or even faster!
      ° Built in message writer to inactive users with a little warning
	note which says that the user shall upload if he don't want to
	get deleted. Just press W and the @{"Account Editor" LINK "About Account ED"} will write a msg
	to the user you are account editing!
      ° Printer output routine improved and is now faster
      ° Whole new routine installed, Messagebase cleaner which deletes all
	your old mail which users have received. Finally there is a util that
	does that and this one also remembers which the last message you
	deleted was!
      ° You can now define in which colour the info in the account editor
	will be printed with, in the preset file.
      ° You can now delete a users questionary when you are editing the
	users account. It has password support so your cosysops don't
	mess up anything :) Inside the editor is the command D
      ° Rebuilt the Presets file again, but this time I've included all
	parameters for both Quest & Account ED which has been inside the
	source before and made it a lot easier to change in! Please
	consult the doc file to see how to upgrade your old Preset file
      ° Help page significantly improved, this time with all commands
      ° Built in the last command that now makes this door 100% Quest
	compatible, so from now on all sysop commands in Quest has been
	removed. Quest will from now on be shipped with Account ED in a new
	special Account ED Edition.
      ° A little bug has been reported in version 1.04 of Account ED, then
	you saved a new users account several times. It has been fixed
	without my knowledge due to the new Search for User routines
      ° Give/Take conference access routine partly rewritten
      ° And as always code optimized, this versions source length is even
	shorter than the previous one and has got much more powerful commands
	that's what I call an update!

 @{b}09-01-93 V1.06@{ub} @{i}My dreams come true@{ui} Never released!

      ° Made it 100% /X 3.1 Compatible so it now works on both /X 2.39
	and /X 3.1. The programs can decide your version and redesign
	the program functions to work on your version. Many functions
	remade to suit the new 2.39/3.1 system. You have to change some
	things in your AccED.Preset file if you have changed to /X 3.1
	since you last used Account ED. They are well explained in the
	doc file for this program
      ° The manual is now rewritten into the AmigaGuide Format which
	allows you to fast gather the required information. The master
	behind this stunning conversion is Jens Eriksson
      ° Redesigned and improved the status window, every action is now
	displayed and commented
      ° Remade the UserInfo Tool so it now has got a new style (TBar),
	has more flexibility and more feature than before. You can now
	get whatever information you want. (Top uploaders etc)
      ° Remade the Give Conference Access Tool so it now works faster
	and has more features
      ° Optimized the date calculation routine to only 2 lines (8 before)
      ° Added in the ability to edit user total calls
      ° Added in the ability to edit user total messages written
      ° Fixed a new input routine for the @{"Account Editor" LINK "About Account ED"} which is faster
	and easier to use.
      ° Implemented the new feature from Quest which lets you load the
	backup of the users account and save it as the old.
      ° Account ED always makes a backup when it saves an account, which
	you later on can load into the old account slot if something goes
	wrong (the new function above)
      ° The Last Date On bug fixed, it will now never stand Unknown, sorry
	should have fixed this bug before!
      ° The routines to load an account optimized and slightly fastened
      ° New, Newuser search routine, which should work.. Please let me
	know if it doesn't work again.. Phew!
      ° Bug with the built in Calculator if you just pressed return or
	entered a wrong value, before it would not give you the old upload
	credits back, it now does
      ° Fixed bug with the security level option inside the @{"Account Editor" LINK "About Account ED"}
      ° Remade the load account routine so it works faster
      ° Remade the save account routine so it works faster
      ° Fixed bug in the search for a user routine so it now works 100%
	and you can search on a user's last name too
      ° The program was so optimized so I saved 100 lines of 630 so the
	program only takes 529 lines now!!!

 @{b}04-08-94 V2.00@{ub} @{i}Touch Down!@{ui}

      ° Finally this program has landed, every single bug which occurred on
	AmiExpress 3.9 and later has been fixed. I got the opportunity to
	install /X 3.9 and fully test the program!
      ° Cygnus ED like edit function in the Account Editor implemented,
	however I could have made it even better if I only could have read
	if a arrow key has been pressed. I would be very happy if someone
	who knows how to do it could tell me and the editor will be even
	better than today.
      ° The editor now tells how long field you may edit with replacing
	the background colour with blue!
      ° Compatibility with the new Quest, questionary format implemented
      ° Check for users upload/download ratio implemented in the userlist
	which now gives you every possible way of getting the information
	you could possible want.
      ° The users language / ASCII choice is now displayed in the editor
      ° Last date on routine optimized again..
      ° Bug in the delete routine for Questionaries was fixed!
      ° Bug in the search routine, due to a new feature fixed!
      ° Bug in the access tool fixed, which didn't affect the last user
      ° Added in new functions in the editor for Chat Limit and Used Chat Time
      ° Added in so you could see what status the user has decided for his
	questionary (when using / in Account ED)
      ° Fixed a great bug in the text editor inside Account ED which
	didn't work when you did pressed a certain key combination
      ° You now can enjoy all the new pause functions in the Account ED
	package, they are added everywhere you could find more than one
	page of text and it uses your default Number of Lines / Screen
      ° Credit Maintenance Util added, which give almost a second editor
	to the package. This editor has been added to match the new
	AmiExpress 3.37 and lets you keep track of your pay users!
      ° Credit UserList Util added to give you a quick overview of all your
	credited users and the total amount of money they've paid to your
	board. Works only on /X3.37 and over!
      ° Amiga guide and distribution files of the package enhanced and
	all documentation for the other doors in this package stuffed
	together with the Account ED Docs, this will hopefully make
	your installation procedure faster!

	Please note that this release is both for V1.06 and V2.00
	because the new design in V1.06 was never released!
@endnode

@node "F6 Editor History"

	@{b}@{u}F6 Editor © Delusion of Virtual 1992, 1993, 1994@{ub}@{uu}

	@{i}F6 Account Editor, History@{ui}

 @{b}04-07-94 V1.01@{ub} @{i}First released in Account ED Package V2.00@{ui}

      ° First released version. This door is a stripped down version of
	Account ED, so any updates made their will sooner or later come
	into this door too! This version is 100% the same as AccED V2.0
      ° If run when someone is not currently online it will launch the
	normal '1' account editor instead!

	NOTE! Many of the security functions has been removed and password
	      checks, and such things too. I thought that there wasn't any
	      need for the sysop to protect him from himself.. By doing this
	      I've decreased the execution time for the door, now it's only
	      180 lines (compared to 700 in Account ED) !!
@endnode

@node "Security Checker History"

	@{b}@{u}Security Checker © Delusion of Virtual 1994@{ub}@{uu}

	@{i}Security Checker, History@{ui}

 @{b}04-08-94 V1.00@{ub}

      ° First released version. Got the idee from The Silencer Door, but
	thought it would be smart if such a util followed with the
	Account ED Package, without extra configuration!
@endnode

@node "Quest History"

	@{b}@{u}Quest, Questionary Helper © Delusion of Virtual 1992, 1993, 1994@{ub}@{uu}

	@{i}Virtual Quest, History@{ui}

 @{b}06-07-92 V1.00@{ub}

      ° Were never officially released due to the lack of functions

 @{b}06-08-92 V1.02@{ub}

      ° The first released version! The most of the functions I had planned
	were Implemented but I will add some more in the next version!

 @{b}06-09-92 V1.03@{ub}

      ° A User can now read his old application, a separate security status
	for that was added in the config file, a bug was fixed! When a user
	had chosen that his answers was NOT correct he was added as a new
	user for every time he took No.. And it was the same with the log
	file but it's fixed now! A bug found then a user was in Quest and
	of some reason got loss off carrier he would be among the new users
	but his answer file would not exist and the program would then crash!
	The program now checks if the file exists before trying to open it!

 @{b}06-19-92 V1.06@{ub}

      ° Fixed the bug with the questionary! It now works as it was explained
	in the manual.. Fixed bug when the program showed an application.

      ° Fixed bug when a user took ? in the sysop menus 2.. It wouldn't dir
	all users only about half of them..

      ° Added an extra option in the config file from which the sysop now can
	terrorize the user if the user don't answer all the questions.. The prg
	will whenever a user just presses return and doesn't write anything
	write a text that says that the user must enter the questions and then
	will the program ask the questions again! Very useful against lazy
	users.. hehe

      ° Added & Fixed so then the user had answered all the questions he/she
	must either press Y or N to continue, before if you pressed return
	it only meant the same as a N and some of my users didn't like that..

      ° Added in a new sysop command! You can now DELETE a users applications
	i.e. if you think the users hasn't answered it seriously or something
	like that! You also must enter a password to do so which you can
	change in the config file!

 @{b}04-07-92 V1.07@{ub}

      ° The users name is now fully displayed even if it consists of spaces
	this has been a nasty bug all the time but I didn't know how to fix
	it until now..

      ° If you list all the applications it will know display it two & two
	it was a bit hard to read before, it took all day..

      ° File note will now append the whole name but if it consists of spaces
	it will replace each space with a '-'..

      ° The routine to read applications who was saved with the answers only
	was optimized and works much faster!

      ° All menus and texts has been optimized and you will see a large
	speed improvement in the program!!!

      ° Some minor bugs was fixed but you will probably not notice any
	difference at all.

      ° Different questionarys at the same time added! I.e. if you have used
	the function save answers only and you want to change your questionary
	you will doubtless get into some serious trouble.. You either have to
	change all your application by yourself (huu) or use this new version
	of Quest which keeps track on from which questionary the answers came!
	If you have old applications quest will simple enough take it for
	granted that they where questioned by questions.1! If you now want
	a new questionary just create a new one and name it questions.2 and
	put it in the same dir as questions.1, then you only has got to change
	the default questionary in the config file to 2! (The variable
	Questionary in the file Quest.CFG)

 @{b}07-10-92 V1.08@{ub}

      ° The delete password is now not displayed on the screen when you
	write it in, there will only be * displayed instead of each char!

      ° A bunch of bugs fixed & the list all applications routine was
	optimized again and is now even faster...

      ° Added in so Quest will write a line in the callerslog if anyone
	deletes the new users log or a users application and of course in
	colour!

 @{b}08-11-92 V1.09@{ub}

      ° You can now search for an application with the users name instead
	of only the slot number.

      ° The listening routine for all users has been redone and is now
	much faster. It gets it's info from the log file nowadays.

      ° All external Dos commands where changed to use internal functions
	that are built in the Rexxsyslib.library, thus the FileNote command
	are still loaded from CLI so please have patience with that.

      ° Many bugs where changed and some unnecessary crap was removed from
	the source! This time it shall WORK!

      ° This version is only an appetizer for version V1.10 with built in
	account ed! So please hold on..

 @{b}05-01-93 V1.10@{ub} @{i}Major Update for /X 2.35+@{ui}

      ° Finally the time for an update has come and it has been worth waiting
	for. What have happened is that all sysop commands has been built in
	to Account ED instead for more efficient and faster user updates.
	Therefor has that code been removed from Quest, and the remaining
	code has been optimized and sometime rewritten. Here are the new
	features!
      ° Added in MCI like commands that will show certain info from the
	questionary in the users account (using Account ED) in coming versions
	of Account ED, this feature is only built in Quest today, but soon
	in Account ED too more info in the Doc file.
      ° All configuration values now are loaded from Account Ed's preset file
	AccEd.Presets
      ° Built in automatic user upgrader so your user can automatically gain
	access after answering the questions. They will get the first preset
	into the AccEd.Presets file if this function is turned on.
      ° Forces all new users to write a letter to sysop about themselves thru
	a built in mail program
      ° Automatically hangs up after the user answered all questions and
	written the letter to sysop if not AutoAccess is on
      ° Gives the user a opportunity to operate sysop before it hangs up
      ° Drops carrier if a user press a defined number of returns
      ° Prompts that the user must answer all questions if a user press return
	and ask the question again (it's configurable)
      ° Automatically deletes the questionary which may exists on the new
	users slot number and moves the one deleted questionary to the QuestDel
	directory and renames it to the users name who answered it so there
	will never be a problem if you forgets to delete a users questionary
	you've deleted!
      ° Old users who answers the questions will not be thrown out and
	doesn't have to write a letter to sysop. Useful if you want all
	your old users to answer you questions with quest instead
      ° Code optimized and almost rewritten

	V1.10 Fix (Released separately)

      ° Bug with the message from new user to sysop fixed, I didn't find it
	then I tested the program because it only shows then someone actually
	is calling as a new user. But now it works great! (You have to change
	in your AccEd.Preset file, more info on that in preset config text)

 @{b}04-08-94 V1.12@{ub} @{i}Made for Account ED Package V2.00@{ui}

      ° With the release of Quest View I needed to do some changes to this
	door as well. First of all it now reads the questionary in the new
	standard and it asks if a user wants his questionary private or not
      ° The *.DAT files has been 20 bytes larger to cover some of the extra
	bits needed to indicate if a user wants his questionary private or
	not, it has also 19 free bytes for future enhancements!
      ° Error in the letter handling fixed to work also on /X 3.0+
      ° There were a little bug which didn't save the last line of the users
	questionary.. It has now been corrected!
      ° Bug fix in the routine for removing old questionaries, when a new
	user logs into an old users slot number
      ° Quest is now able to detect the difference between a deleted
	account and a new user who logs in, so if you already has answered
	the questions and runs quest again, you won't have to answer the
	questions again. This is useful if you have Quest as a MCI command
	in a login bulletin which all users sees, this will force all users
	who hasn't answered the questionary to do so!
      ° Quest is now fixed to work with the new Preset file for V2.00
      ° You now can choose if your questionary should be secret for other
	users on the board!
@endnode

@node "Quest View History"

	@{b}@{u}Quest View © Delusion of Virtual 1993, 1994@{ub}@{uu}

	@{i}Quest View, History@{ui}

 @{b}04-08-93 V1.00@{ub}

      ° First version made. I got the idea when I called a PC Board, where
	you could look up other users information and I thought, hey maybe
	I should use the information stored in the questionaries for this
	and here the util is. I hope your users will like it!

      ° Added in the feature to also display some info from the user data
	about the users (Asked by Chucky of Virtual)
@endnode

